{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_07",
  "title": "健康零食",
  "storyCode": "DT-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8d61bb1a585bb09a57747026e526012580f8773b603614d1c66c1c040c96b5fa",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "打、打完了？都解決掉了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "哈……哈……累死我了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "哈哈哈！不錯啊小丫頭，你那幾招真有點意思，老子果然最喜歡術師了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "哎呀呀……還好大家沒打起來，人都沒事就好，人都沒事就好……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "走，老子今天心情好！帶你們去吃老子自己種的玉米！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "text": "大哥，你……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "嗯？……玉米？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "剛還在哈哈大笑的拓荒者一下子爬了起來，舉起武器，對準小隊四人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "呼……呼……看來他這是回神了，我剛才真的以為他要跟我們握手和好呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪露希爾也抬起法杖，頭髮隨著魔法微微地蕩漾起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "欸？欸？幾位這又是怎麼回事？怎麼又要打起來了？剛還同生共死呢，你們不是和好了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "……哼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克&先西",
      "text": "呼……呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "瑪露希爾，你先別施展魔法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……不然這樣吧，大家剛處理完這些東西，都很累了，再打下去沒什麼好處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我們數三聲，都放下武器，各自退回原來的地方，保證今晚互不打擾，怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "咳咳咳咳！！怎……麼……樣……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "看看這位大哥多有誠意啊，都這樣了還在堅持！幾位看呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "text": "大哥，我們的人也累慘了，再打下去沒好處啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "……好，數三聲，今晚互不打擾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "哎呀！真好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "三、二、一！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "真好……晚上可以睡個安穩覺了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "Zzz……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "瑪露希爾？瑪露希爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "Zzz……嗯？……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "啊！發、發生什麼事了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "沒有，瑪露希爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我們想去看看剛才那些魔物的構造，順便……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫覺得那些東西很像螃蟹，吃起來或許就是寶箱怪的味道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "啊啊，寶箱怪很有嚼勁的，而且越嚼越好吃……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "只要你們別再用我的開鎖工具去挖肉吃就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "可是那個真的很好用！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "《鮑勃的美食指南》上寫了這種東西是可以吃的，味道很鮮美，就是破開外殼有點麻煩！你不想吃看看嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不想！而且被誤會成是返回戰場準備偷襲的話，說不定還要再打一場！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那些滿天亂飛的魔法器具很煩，那邊現在還有不少！我也很累——\n欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧吧唧……欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "text": "吧唧……欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者&萊歐斯小隊",
      "text": "欸？？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拓荒者們正往嘴裡塞鉗獸腳的手僵硬地停住了。\n漫長的靜止裡只有篝火燃燒的聲音。\n噼——啪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "原來牠的鉗子裡長著這麼多肉，難怪能夠支撐起沉重的外殼，還能鉗碎那些魔法器具……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "是從腹部下刀殺死的，也掀開了後蓋，原來如此，看來處理牠的方式和處理寶箱怪相同。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "而且……嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "好香！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "呃……試試？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……咕~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萊歐斯伸手接過了烤好的肉，猶豫了一下，塞進嘴裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……嗯~！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "好好吃喔！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "哈哈！老子的手藝……咳！呃……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……你也吃看看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……嗯……？真的很有嚼勁！很香欸！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "text": "喂，給你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "欸？我也有？謝了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "烤得恰到好處，沒有損失水分，真的和寶箱怪的味道很像！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "咳，吃就完事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "吃完嘴巴閉緊，老子還是要外面的名聲的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "今晚的事誰都別說出去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者&萊歐斯小隊&瑞恩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "（為什麼你們白天打得你死我活的，現在卻坐在這裡一起吃烤肉啊？！我根本就沒必要趕過來啊……）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "我只是半夜上廁所路過，什麼都沒看到啊哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "*俚語*算了……過來吧！你送藥給我們，老子心裡記著的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "這件事就，就這樣算了吧——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "……不行，不能這樣算了！老子的糧倉啊！你們為什麼要炸老子的糧倉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "才沒有！是你們的魔法器具先攻擊我們，我們為了自衛才被迫反擊的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "魔、魔法器具？你叫無人機這個？它們都瘋了，哪還聽我的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "欸……可是你們還從村子裡面跑出來攻擊我們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "你們要來搶我們的物資啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "哪有這種事——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "停停停，我算是聽懂了！這就是一場誤會！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "你們的無人機失控炸了他們，他們以為你們要攻擊他們，你們又以為他們要趁著天災搶你們的東西——都是誤會！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "既然都是誤會，各位握個手和好怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "不要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "當我沒說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "我……被……冰……住……了……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "那……先……解……決……它……們……怎……麼……樣……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "是基站被毀了嗎，我之前學過一點維修，讓我想想怎麼修……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "嘖！有沒有懂源石迴路的過來幫我一下？剩下的人解決無人機，先消耗一下它們的炸彈！這樣炸下去什麼事都做不了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "走吧，我們去把無人機引開，你們動作快點！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者們",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "我只能幫他們把這個基站的外殼儘快拆開，瑪露希爾，你對這個魔法器具真的沒有一點辦法嗎？總不能讓先西把它們都煮了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯——嗯——現學一門全新的魔法體系是需要一定時間的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "又有兩個魔法器具飛過去了……！它們移動的速度很規律，來回巡邏的路線也很規律……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "一個魔法器具只攜帶一枚炸彈，看起來它們投下炸彈後就會立刻飛離現場，是回去補充炸彈嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯&瑪露希爾",
      "text": "一下子想不出什麼好辦法啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "其實老夫有一個想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯&瑪露希爾",
      "text": "什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "你們認為，這些魔法器具是靠什麼來分辨敵人的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "它們不是魔物，沒有眼睛來看什麼是“敵人”，但它們只能進行一次投彈，所以它們就必須要有甄別敵人的能力……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "沒錯。老夫剛才注意到，那個魔法器具對一隻死了的鉗獸毫無反應。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "但之後，老夫看到一隻鉗獸不小心誤入了魔法器具的包圍圈，原本魔法器具也毫無反應，鉗獸豎起鉗子的時候，卻立刻受到了攻擊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……所以，是“敵意”嗎？被認定成有敵意就會遭到攻擊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "啊，那我知道該怎麼消耗炸彈了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "用使魔來吸引魔法器具吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "使魔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不用特別複雜，只要足夠充滿敵意就可以了，材料就用剛才那些鉗獸吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "那些野果也可以拿來加進去。你們先把它們都堆在一起，我想一想究竟做個什麼樣的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "等等，你剪自己的頭髮做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "頭髮也會有魔法的力量，是很好用的材料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "一些麵粉，一把糖，再用一點奶油捏合起來，加上現實的參考……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯？你看我做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "啊，我知道要做什麼樣的使魔了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "（咒語）……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "做好了？是什麼樣的？什麼樣的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "使魔版萊歐斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克&瑞恩&先西",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "這不是我嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "好了，讓我先試一下啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "左腳、右腳、左腳、右腳……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "使魔版萊歐斯",
      "text": "（有樣學樣）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "跑起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "使魔版萊歐斯",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "出發！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者們",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊——啊啊啊啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者們",
      "text": "你們到底修好了沒有啊？再不修好出人命了！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "來了！來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拓荒者們大喜回頭，卻看到一個詭異的身影伴隨著他們從沒聽過的僵硬聲音，火速向他們靠近。\n在荒野上見慣了嗜血野獸、經歷過大大小小的天災，此刻又被數十架無人機窮追猛打的他們也忍不住戰慄起來——\n一個男人正手腳著地，吐著長長的舌頭，雙目圓睜著，一邊不斷地發出恐怖的嘶吼，一邊貼地爬行，飛速朝他們逼近！\n左腳！右腳！左腳！右腳！啊……\n我到底是為什麼要做到這一步啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "使魔版萊歐斯",
      "text": "（有樣學樣）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者們",
      "text": "……呃啊啊啊啊啊！！快跑！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你們快退！我來吸引這些魔法器具！不要在這裡停留了，你們都先回——\n欸？怎麼一下子都跑光了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……！啊，果然吸引了它們的注意力！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "只需要把它們都引到沒有人的地方，然後讓它們把炸彈都丟在使魔身上就好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "這一帶都是平原，感覺沒有問題……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "啊！差點忘了！它們又不會聽我的話等到了地方才開始攻擊啊！現在就已經開始了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不行，這裡的距離還是太近了，我一定也會被打到，還是要再遠一點點……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "成功了！瑪露希爾帶著無人機都往那邊去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "只要成功把炸彈消耗完就好了！她真厲害啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "你們的“魔法”真是有夠詭……呃，真夠厲害的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "啊啊啊！比想像中難纏很多啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "使魔版萊歐斯",
      "text": "哈……哈……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "等等，這個聲音……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "要炸了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "這裡……這裡可以嗎？足夠遠了吧？我要趕快跑了！使魔萊歐斯，一切就靠你了，我不會再操控你了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "使魔版萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "嘿，我看到她跑出來了！無人機要炸了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "萬歲！成功了！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "這小丫頭很厲害啊……老子就說自己蠻喜歡術師的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "啊，瑪露希爾果然很厲害啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "等一下，老夫記得……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "那邊是不是玉米地？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "好像還真的是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "等等，那是老子的玉米地啊啊啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "要炸了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "這裡能躲一下……唔——啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "想像中的爆炸如期發生了。\n但一股玉米的清香突兀地散了開來。\n瑪露希爾抬起頭，時間彷彿很慢，慢到她能夠看清一顆小小的玉米粒飛上了天空，在數十架無人機的轟炸下，爆出了雪白香甜的爆米花。\n玉米花像雪一樣飛舞，像雪一樣飄落，掉落在她的鼻尖上。\n瑪露希爾打了個冷顫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但隨即，她被更多的爆米花掩埋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "這、這是……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "爆米花！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我超級強的喔，就算有一百個……呃，九十九個爆米花，我都吃得下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嘿呀！看我砰——啪！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "爆米花大山，我來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "瑪露希爾！瑪露希爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "瑪露希爾！你在哪？你能聽到我們說話嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "完了，瑪露希爾，這裡是不能復活的啊……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧吧唧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫又聽到了熟悉的聲音……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "是小刻小姐吃飯的聲音……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧吧唧……喔！鬍子大叔！是你們啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "小刻妹妹？你怎麼會在這裡？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "我聞到這裡有好吃的味道，我就過來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "鬍子大叔，小個子哥哥和金頭髮哥哥！這裡有爆米花，還有冰凍果子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧吧唧……還有……吧唧吧唧……金頭髮姐姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不……要……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不……要……吃我的……頭髮……啊！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "呸呸呸！對不起！我不是故意的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "瑪露希爾！你沒有死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "咳咳咳……我只是被埋住了，沒有被炸到……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "哇~這些焦焦的味道很香！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "而且冰冰的！和爆米花不一樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "唉……真是的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "要試試嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧……涼涼甜甜的，好好吃喔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "啊！你們沒事就好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "啊？……小刻？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "……嗯？我記得你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "你是和我一起來打獵的！你都打到了什麼？我打到了好多東西，但都被我吃掉了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "你……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "算了。前輩說得沒錯，能找到就算完成任務，別管是怎麼找到的……等等，你嘴裡在吃什麼？吐出來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "嚼嚼嚼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "你是不是在亂吃東西？吐出來，吐出來啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧吧唧……咕嚕！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "啊！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "沒事，小刻小姐吃的是爆米花。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "天啊，老子的狗屎運氣！這些玉米是要賣了換錢的啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "text": "老大，別這樣說，你自己就是佩洛啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "弄成這樣了還怎麼賣錢？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "爆米花其實也可以賣，在帳篷區一定會有人買的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "放入奶油和砂糖再趁熱攪拌一下，嗯……香味更明顯了！是一道不錯的小零食。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "冰凍水果團子搗碎後加上使魔的麵糊部分攪拌，用湯匙定型……就是冰淇淋！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "是一道不錯的甜點！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "…………",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "唉……唉……爆米花的確是也可以賣啦……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "事已至此……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "先吃點吧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "咳咳……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "你還沒恢復過來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "只是一下子聞了太多玉米的味道……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "但它們真的好好吃……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "爆米花熱呼呼的，又有奶油的香氣，又甜又脆……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "冰淇淋也很好吃，這些水果都很新鮮，口感也很絲滑……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "而且不是什麼魔物的肉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯~~~好幸福……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "呼……總算是告一段落了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "嗯……嘿嘿……好好吃，冰淇淋……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "唉……真是個讓人不放心的孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "text": "喂，我先把她帶回去了，你們可別再和那群人打起來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "好了好了，我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑞恩說著，將吃飽喝足躺在地上沉沉睡去的刻俄柏扶起，把她搬到停靠在不遠處的車上。\n隨著引擎啟動，車揚長而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "咦——小刻呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "你說那個小姐？瑞恩把她帶走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "瑞恩？為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "他好像說是什麼羅德島的任務吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "什麼，你說羅德島？！瑞恩是羅德島來的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "你怎麼這麼驚訝？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "萊歐斯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "羅德島就在這附近嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "啊，嗯，他們現在就停靠在幾公里外的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "他們還沒有走太久，現在追上去還來得及。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我們走吧！要是這次再追丟了就不好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "text": "他們在說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
